      "content": "i know... but it's not like anyone can actually fix it. how do you fix a house that's already rotting from the inside? it feels like there's nothing left to save. everything is just getting heavier and quieter. it feels so much more peaceful to just accept that the lights are going out than to keep fighting to see in the dark.",
